---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { REPO } from '../i18n';
import { link } from '../data/sources';
import SourcesList from '../components/SourcesList.astro';
---
<Base lang="en" page="credits" title="Sources and credits · Traces Blanches" description="The papers behind the calculations of Traces Blanches (avalanche terrain, runout, skiing time) and the sources of its maps and information (IGN, OpenStreetMap, Météo-France, ARCEP, refuges.info, Camptocamp…), with the credit and licence of each.">
<div class="text">
<h1>Sources and credits</h1>
<p class="lead">The calculations of Traces Blanches rest on published work, and its maps and information come from public sources. Here are both, with the credit and licence each one asks for.</p>
<ul class="toc">
<li><a href="#sources">Sources</a></li>
<li><a href="#credits">Data and their credits</a></li>
<li><a href="#maps">Maps on this site</a></li>
<li><a href="#site">This website</a></li>
</ul>
<p>In the app, a small ⓘ in a corner of the map opens the sources and licences of the data it shows, with the version of each pack.</p>
</div>

<SourcesList lang="en" />

